OL,3,GNEWSACabbie takes ill children on
OL,4,AChristmas lights tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi driver helped bring Christmas
OL,7,Fcheer to dozens of seriously ill
OL,8,Fchildren by taking them on a free tour
OL,9,Fof London's festive lights.
OL,11,FPaul Evans was among 28 black cab
OL,12,Fdrivers who took youngsters being
OL,13,Ftreated at Great Ormond Street Hospital
OL,14,F(GOSH) and their families on a special
OL,15,Ftrip around the capital on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe taxis, decorated with fairy lights
OL,18,Fand tinsel, passed landmarks including
OL,19,FRegent Street and the London Eye.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
