OL,3,GNEWSACabbie takes ill children on
OL,4,AChristmas lights tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvans, from Ongar, Essex, said the
OL,7,Fevent was about creating "a bit of
OL,8,FChristmas magic" for families facing
OL,9,Fserious illness.
